--- !u!114 &401489690
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 401489688}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1ab18b11fc007447180abcb24ce727d3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  audioSource: {fileID: 401489689}
  captionBox: {fileID: 1957230969}
  captionLingerTime: 0.1
  spanishFont: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec752da0268ee4eb48f9eab01ba26e37, type: 2}
  openingLine:
    english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ae15ba57a603458c8b1545aada74218, type: 3}
    spanish: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5cb109fb9093644489b9f16b6217fa6e, type: 3}
  openingCaption:
    english: Santi the sloth loves to climb trees. How can we find a way to check
      his blood pressure? We need to get Santi to move to another part of the tree
      so that the blood pressure cuff can be placed on his free arm.
    spanish: "A Santi, el perezoso, le encanta trepar a los \xE1rboles. \xBFC\xF3mo
      podemos encontrar la manera de tomarle la presi\xF3n arterial? Necesitamos
      lograr que Santi se mueva a otra parte del \xE1rbol para poder colocarle el
      brazalete de presi\xF3n en su brazo libre."
  completionLine:
    english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2ae15ba57a603458c8b1545aada74218, type: 3}
    spanish: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9861290ba5c0d4f58b9cb2a31e7ccdf4, type: 3}
  completionCaption:
    english: And Santi the sloth has very good blood pressure. Baby sloths eat soft
      leaves while holding onto their mom's tummies.
    spanish: "Y Santi el perezoso tiene una presi\xF3n arterial muy buena. Los perezosos
      beb\xE9s comen hojas tiernas mientras se aferran a la barriga de sus mam\xE1s."
  nudgeOnFixedTimer: 0
  nudgeDelay: 5
  nudgeInterval: 6
  nudgeLines:
  - english: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6056826ac63954ce1b1dfed9d356ec71, type: 3}
    spanish: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 086583233b56041aab1ba658bb5004cc, type: 3}
  nudgeCaptions:
  - english: Tap inside the drop zones to see if you can help Santi hold on with
      only one arm.
    spanish: Toca dentro de las zonas marcadas para ver si puedes ayudar a Santi
      a sostenerse con un solo brazo.
  - english: Choose another part of the tree and see if Santi will go there, then
      bring the blood pressure cuff up to his arm.
    spanish: "Elige otra parte del \xE1rbol y mira si Santi va hacia all\xED; luego,
      ac\xE9rcale el manguito del tensi\xF3metro al brazo."
